msgstr ""
"| `rl_config.enable_training_consistency=true` | 训练-推理一致性 | 选择 FA3；需要 "
"`flash_attn_npu_v3` 包 |"

msgid ""
"| `rl_config.enable_batch_invariant=true` | Reproducible rollouts | Enable "
"batch-invariant kernels and deterministic communication settings |"
msgstr ""
"| `rl_config.enable_batch_invariant=true` | 可复现的 rollout | 启用批量不变内核和确定性通信设置 "
"|"

msgid ""
"| `--weight-transfer-config '{\"backend\": \"hccl\"}'` | Cross-NPU weight "
