msgstr ""
"| `--weight-transfer-config '{\"backend\": \"hccl\"}'` | 跨 NPU 权重传输 | 注册 "
"Ascend HCCL 传输引擎 |"

msgid ""
"| `--weight-transfer-config '{\"backend\": \"ipc\"}'` | Same-NPU weight "
"transfer | Select the Ascend NPU IPC transfer engine |"
msgstr ""
"| `--weight-transfer-config '{\"backend\": \"ipc\"}'` | 同 NPU 权重传输 | 选择 "
"Ascend NPU IPC 传输引擎 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-return-routed-experts` | MoE router replay | Return encoded "
"expert routing decisions |"
msgstr "| `--enable-return-routed-experts` | MoE 路由器重放 | 返回编码后的专家路由决策 |"

msgid ""
"For the Ascend-specific option definitions, see\n"
"[Additional Configuration](../configuration/additional_config.md) and\n"
"[Environment Variables](../configuration/env_vars.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关 Ascend "
"特定的选项定义，请参阅[附加配置](../configuration/additional_config.md)和[环境变量](../configuration/env_vars.md)。"

msgid "## Trace Replay"
msgstr "## 轨迹回放"

msgid ""
"The output tokens will always be `[15, 284, 1026, 374]`. The logprobs "
"reflect the model's true probability for each forced token under the current"
" inference configuration."
msgstr ""
"输出的 token 将始终为 `[15, 284, 1026, 374]`。logprobs 反映的是在当前推理配置下，模型对每个强制 token "
"的真实概率。"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-trace-replay` | trace replay | Forces decoding to follow a "
"predetermined token sequence |"
msgstr "| `--enable-trace-replay` | 轨迹回放 | 强制解码遵循预定的 token 序列 |"

msgid ""
"1. initialize the transfer engine;\n"
"2. pause generation;\n"
"3. start the weight update;\n"
"4. transfer one or more groups of weights;\n"
"5. finish the weight update;\n"
"6. resume generation."
msgstr ""
"1. 初始化传输引擎；\n"
"2. 暂停生成；\n"
"3. 开始权重更新；\n"
"4. 传输一组或多组权重；\n"
"5. 完成权重更新；\n"
"6. 恢复生成。"

msgid ""
"vLLM-Ascend exposes the following Ascend-specific weight-transfer backends:"
msgstr "vLLM-Ascend 提供以下昇腾专用的权重传输后端："

msgid ""
"| `sparse_hccl` | Replace selected checkpoint weight values on separate NPUs"
" | HCCL collectives |"
msgstr "| `sparse_hccl` | 在独立 NPU 上替换选定的检查点权重值 | HCCL 集合通信 |"

msgid ""
"The table describes transport choices. Sparse transfer requires the trainer and\n"
"rollout engine to start from the same checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"该表描述了传输方式的选择。稀疏传输要求训练器和\n"
"推理引擎从相同的检查点启动。"

msgid "The repository contains runnable examples for weight transfer:"
msgstr "仓库中包含可运行的权重传输示例："

msgid ""
"- [`rlhf_http_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_hccl.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_http_npu_ipc.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_npu_ipc.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_async_new_apis.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_async_new_apis.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_sparse_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/182ea0448550a970e4f0ae3624fe35e38b37bc80/examples/rl/rlhf_sparse_hccl.py)"
msgstr ""
"- [`rlhf_http_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_hccl.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_http_npu_ipc.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_npu_ipc.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_async_new_apis.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_async_new_apis.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_sparse_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/182ea0448550a970e4f0ae3624fe35e38b37bc80/examples/rl/rlhf_sparse_hccl.py)"

msgid "#### Sparse HCCL"
msgstr "#### 稀疏 HCCL"

msgid ""
"For sparse checkpoint updates, follow the upstream [Sparse NCCL\n"
"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/weight_transfer/nccl/#sparse-nccl)\n"
"for patch semantics and the update lifecycle. On Ascend, select `sparse_hccl`\n"
"and enable RL mode:"
msgstr ""
"对于稀疏检查点更新，请参阅上游 [Sparse NCCL\n"
"指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/weight_transfer/nccl/#sparse-nccl)\n"
"了解补丁语义和更新生命周期。在昇腾上，选择 `sparse_hccl`\n"
"并启用 RL 模式："

msgid ""
"Run `rlhf_sparse_hccl.py` to initialize the trainer and send sparse checkpoint\n"
"updates. Its TP2 launch commands explicitly enable expert parallelism. Reserve\n"
"a separate NPU for the trainer; the transfer group size is `1 + TP * DP`, with\n"
"no additional EP factor. Pipeline parallelism is currently unsupported."
msgstr ""
"运行 `rlhf_sparse_hccl.py` 以初始化训练器并发送稀疏检查点\n"
"更新。其 TP2 启动命令显式启用专家并行。请为训练器预留\n"
"独立的 NPU；传输组大小为 `1 + TP * DP`，\n"
"不包含额外的 EP 因子。目前不支持流水线并行。"

msgid ""
"Sparse HCCL requires unquantized ND weights and static expert placement with\n"
"EPLB disabled. FRACTAL_NZ, fused MC2 expert weight lists, draft models, and packed\n"
"sparse updates are unsupported. Updates apply in place: after a failed update,\n"
"keep generation paused until the baseline is restored or the engine restarts."
msgstr ""
"稀疏 HCCL 要求使用未量化的 ND 权重，并采用静态专家放置且\n"
"禁用 EPLB。不支持 FRACTAL_NZ、融合 MC2 专家权重列表、草稿模型以及打包\n"
"稀疏更新。更新为原地应用：更新失败后，\n"
"请保持生成暂停，直到基线恢复或引擎重启。"

msgid "### Sampling Mask (Distribution Replay)"
msgstr "### 采样掩码（分布回放）"

msgid ""
"During RL rollout inference, top-k/top-p/min-p sampling truncates the model's\n"
"distribution. Sampling Mask returns the retained token IDs for each generated\n"
"position, so training can normalize policy probabilities over the same support\n"
"used during rollout. See the upstream\n"
"[Sampling Mask (Distribution Replay) guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/sampling_mask/)\n"
"for training-side usage."
msgstr ""
"在 RL rollout 推理过程中，top-k/top-p/min-p 采样会截断模型的\n"
"分布。采样掩码会返回每个生成位置保留的 token ID，\n"
"以便训练时在与 rollout 相同的支撑集上归一化策略概率。\n"
"训练侧用法请参阅上游\n"
"[采样掩码（分布回放）指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/sampling_mask/)。"

msgid ""
"With sampling-mask capture enabled, requests must use\n"
"`temperature > 0` and `top_k > 0`. Send pre-tokenized input to\n"
"`/inference/v1/generate`:"
msgstr ""
"启用采样掩码捕获后，请求必须使用\n"
"`temperature > 0` 和 `top_k > 0`。将预分词输入发送到\n"
"`/inference/v1/generate`："

msgid ""
"Each choice returns one support set per generated token. The following tested\n"
"Qwen3-0.6B response excerpt omits metadata, ranks, and `top_logprobs`:"
msgstr ""
"每个 choice 为每个生成的 token 返回一个支撑集。以下经过测试的\n"
"Qwen3-0.6B 响应摘录省略了元数据、rank 和 `top_logprobs`："

msgid ""
"Basic distribution replay needs the complete mask and the sampled token's old\n"
"logprob. During training, apply the saved mask to the current policy's logits\n"
"to compute that token's new logprob. Old logprobs for every candidate token are\n"
"not required."
msgstr ""
"基本的分布回放需要完整的掩码以及被采样 token 的旧\n"
"logprob。训练时，将保存的掩码应用于当前策略的 logits\n"
"以计算该 token 的新 logprob。无需为每个候选 token 保存\n"
"旧 logprob。"

msgid ""
"The sampled token belongs to its corresponding support. Mask size is independent\n"
"of `logprobs`, and top-k ties can retain more than `top_k` tokens. With\n"
"`stream=true`, concatenate token and mask chunks by choice index and token\n"
"position."
msgstr ""
"被采样的 token 属于其对应的支撑集。掩码大小与\n"
"`logprobs` 无关，且 top-k 并列时可能保留超过 `top_k` 个 token。当\n"
"`stream=true` 时，请按 choice 索引和 token 位置拼接 token 与掩码\n"
"分块。"

msgid ""
"For an MTP-capable model, speculative decoding is supported with fixed\n"
"verification boundaries. Add the following configuration to the server command:"
msgstr ""
"对于支持 MTP 的模型，支持具有固定\n"
"验证边界的投机解码。将以下配置添加到服务器命令中："

msgid ""
"Each committed token receives the processed target-model support at its\n"
"position. The mask does not record draft or acceptance probabilities."
msgstr ""
"每个已提交的 token 都会在其位置获得处理后的目标模型支撑集。\n"
"掩码不记录草稿概率或接受概率。"

msgid ""
"On Ascend, supports are packed on the NPU and decoded on the CPU using the\n"
"exact bitmask fallback. This preserves the complete support but adds transfer,\n"
"CPU decoding, and response-size overhead. The adapter requires the upstream\n"
"request-major sampling-mask interface."
msgstr ""
"在昇腾上，支撑集在 NPU 上打包，并使用精确位掩码回退在 CPU 上\n"
"解码。这保留了完整的支撑集，但会增加传输、\n"
"CPU 解码和响应大小的开销。该适配器需要上游的\n"
"request-major 采样掩码接口。"

msgid ""
"Diffusion models, custom logits processors, adaptive verification, and the\n"
"batch-sharded LM-head gather path are not supported for this feature.\n"
"Sampling masks contain neither probability values nor RNG state; they do not\n"
"force a token sequence as [Trace Replay](#trace-replay) does."
msgstr ""
"此功能不支持扩散模型、自定义 logits 处理器、自适应验证以及\n"
"批次分片的 LM-head gather 路径。\n"
"采样掩码既不包含概率值也不包含 RNG 状态；它不会像\n"
"[Trace Replay](#trace-replay) 那样强制 token 序列。"

msgid ""
"The experimental token-in/token-out (TITO) endpoint accepts pre-tokenized\n"
"prompts and, by default (`output_mode=\"tokens\"`), returns generated token IDs.\n"
"Apply tokenization and any chat template on the client before sending\n"
"`token_ids`. Choose one of two serving modes:"
msgstr ""
"实验性的 token-in/token-out (TITO) 端点接受预分词的\n"
"提示，并默认（`output_mode=\"tokens\"`）返回生成的 token ID。\n"
"在发送 `token_ids` 之前，请在客户端完成分词和任何聊天模板的\n"
"应用。请选择以下两种服务模式之一："

msgid ""
"`--tokens-only` uses token output and does not support stop strings; use\n"
"`sampling_params.stop_token_ids` instead. A normal server started without\n"
"either flag returns HTTP 403 for TITO requests, with a message to enable\n"
"`--enable-scale-out`."
msgstr ""
"`--tokens-only` 使用 token 输出，不支持停止字符串；请改用\n"
"`sampling_params.stop_token_ids`。未使用任一标志启动的普通服务器\n"
"对 TITO 请求返回 HTTP 403，并提示启用\n"
"`--enable-scale-out`。"

msgid "Send a non-streaming request to `/inference/v1/generate`:"
msgstr "向 `/inference/v1/generate` 发送非流式请求："

msgid ""
"The following non-streaming response excerpt illustrates the structure for a\n"
"request that reaches the two-token limit. Token IDs and logprob values are\n"
"illustrative, not captured model output; other response fields are omitted:"
msgstr ""
"以下非流式响应摘录展示了达到两个 token 上限的请求的\n"
"结构。Token ID 和 logprob 值仅为示意，并非实际捕获的模型输出；\n"
"其他响应字段已省略："

msgid ""
"In token output mode, `choices[].logprobs.content` contains an integer\n"
"`token_id`, its `logprob` and `rank`, and `top_logprobs` for each generated\n"
"position. Non-streaming responses include `usage` without requiring\n"
"`stream_options.include_usage`. Here, three prompt tokens and two completion\n"
"tokens give five total tokens; `stop_reason` is `null` because generation\n"
"reached `max_tokens`."
msgstr ""
"在 token 输出模式下，`choices[].logprobs.content` 为每个生成位置包含一个整数\n"
"`token_id`、其 `logprob` 和 `rank`，以及 `top_logprobs`。\n"
"非流式响应包含 `usage`，无需设置\n"
"`stream_options.include_usage`。此处三个提示 token 和两个补全\n"
"token 共计五个 token；`stop_reason` 为 `null`，因为生成\n"
"达到了 `max_tokens`。"

msgid ""
"Set `stream=true` to receive server-sent events (SSE), ending with\n"
"`data: [DONE]`. To cancel an in-flight request, send a POST to\n"
"`/inference/v1/abort_requests` with a JSON body containing `request_ids`, a\n"
"list of IDs returned by the server (including the `generate-tokens-` prefix),\n"
"rather than the original client-supplied IDs."
msgstr ""
"设置 `stream=true` 以接收服务器发送事件（SSE），并以\n"
"`data: [DONE]` 结束。要取消正在进行的请求，请向\n"
"`/inference/v1/abort_requests` 发送 POST 请求，JSON 请求体包含 `request_ids`，即\n"
"服务器返回的 ID 列表（包括 `generate-tokens-` 前缀），\n"
"而不是客户端最初提供的 ID。"

msgid ""
"For the full protocol and the `text` output mode, which requires a tokenizer,\n"
"see the upstream\n"
"[TITO guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/online_serving/token_in_token_out/).\n"
"The [Tokens API RFC](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/22817)\n"
"provides design background."
msgstr ""
"有关完整协议以及需要分词器的 `text` 输出模式，\n"
"请参阅上游\n"
"[TITO 指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/online_serving/token_in_token_out/)。\n"
"[Tokens API RFC](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/22817)\n"
"提供了设计背景。"

msgid ""
"| `--return-sampling-mask` | Sampling Mask (Distribution Replay) | Return "
"the support set for each generated token; disabled by default |"
msgstr "| `--return-sampling-mask` | 采样掩码（分布回放） | 返回每个生成 token 的支持集；默认禁用 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-scale-out` | Token-in/token-out requests on a normal server | "
"Register `/inference/v1/generate`; `--tokens-only` also registers this "
"endpoint |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-scale-out` | 普通服务器上的 token 输入/token 输出请求 | 注册 "
"`/inference/v1/generate`；`--tokens-only` 也会注册此端点 |"

msgid "### Weight checker"
msgstr "### 权重校验器"

msgid ""
"The Weight Checker helps validate the weight-transfer path during development.\n"
"It computes SHA-256 digests for model parameters on each rank, resets the\n"
"parameters, and checks whether transferring the original weights back restores\n"
"the same digests. See the upstream\n"
"[Weight Checker guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/weight_checker/)\n"
"for the full API."
msgstr ""
"权重校验器用于在开发过程中验证权重传输路径。它会在每个 rank 上计算模型参数的 SHA-256 摘要，重置参数，并检查将原始权重传回后是否能恢复相同的摘要。完整 API 请参阅上游的\n"
"[Weight Checker 指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/weight_checker/)。"

msgid "All three operations use `POST /weight_checker`:"
msgstr "这三个操作均使用 `POST /weight_checker`："

msgid "| Action | Purpose | Request body | Response |"
msgstr "| 操作 | 用途 | 请求体 | 响应 |"

msgid ""
"| `checksum` | Compute the current digest of each checked parameter without "
"changing it. Save the result as the baseline before resetting weights. | "
"`{\"action\":\"checksum\"}` | `{\"checksums\": {key: sha256_hex}}` |"
msgstr ""
"| `checksum` | 在不修改参数的情况下计算每个被校验参数的当前摘要。在重置权重之前将结果保存为基线。 | "
"`{\"action\":\"checksum\"}` | `{\"checksums\": {key: sha256_hex}}` |"

msgid ""
"| `reset` | Zero the checked parameters to test the transfer path. The model"
" cannot serve valid requests until its weights are restored. | "
"`{\"action\":\"reset\"}` | `{\"status\":\"reset\"}` |"
msgstr ""
"| `reset` | 将被校验参数置零，以测试传输路径。在权重恢复之前，模型无法处理有效请求。 | `{\"action\":\"reset\"}` "
"| `{\"status\":\"reset\"}` |"

msgid ""
"| `compare` | Compute current digests and compare them with the baseline "
"supplied by the caller. | `{\"action\":\"compare\",\"baseline\":{key: "
"sha256_hex}}` | `{\"match\":bool,\"mismatches\":[key]}` |"
msgstr ""
"| `compare` | 计算当前摘要，并与调用方提供的基线进行比较。 | "
"`{\"action\":\"compare\",\"baseline\":{key: sha256_hex}}` | "
"`{\"match\":bool,\"mismatches\":[key]}` |"

msgid ""
"A checksum key has the form `dp{dp}:pp{pp}:pcp{pcp}:tp{tp}:{tensor_name}`,\n"
"so each shard is checked separately. Expert-parallel ranks are identified by\n"
"their DP/PCP/TP coordinates; there is no separate `ep` field. The server does\n"
"not retain the baseline between requests: save the `checksum` response and\n"
"pass its `checksums` object to `compare`."
msgstr ""
"校验键的格式为 `dp{dp}:pp{pp}:pcp{pcp}:tp{tp}:{tensor_name}`，因此每个分片都会被单独校验。专家并行 "
"rank 通过其 DP/PCP/TP 坐标来标识；不存在单独的 `ep` 字段。服务器不会在请求之间保留基线：请保存 `checksum` "
"的响应，并将其中的 `checksums` 对象传给 `compare`。"

msgid ""
"The standard check transfers the *same original weights* after `reset` and\n"
"expects `compare` to report a full match. An old baseline should not match\n"
"weights changed by a real training step. This procedure validates the\n"
"weight-transfer path, not the correctness of newly trained weights."
msgstr ""
"标准检查会在 `reset` 之后传输*相同的原始权重*，并期望 `compare` "
"报告完全匹配。旧基线不应与经过真实训练步骤修改后的权重匹配。此流程验证的是权重传输路径，而不是新训练权重的正确性。"

msgid "#### Example"
msgstr "#### 示例"

msgid ""
"Use an installed vLLM-Ascend environment with compatible vLLM, CANN and\n"
"TorchNPU, including the compiled Ascend custom operators. The paired vLLM\n"
"must provide the Weight Checker API and the weight-transfer trainer API used\n"
"below. Use the dependency versions selected by your vLLM-Ascend checkout;\n"
"changing only `PYTHONPATH` does not install its custom operators."
msgstr ""
"请使用已安装的 vLLM-Ascend 环境，并确保其 vLLM、CANN 和 TorchNPU 版本兼容，且包含已编译的昇腾自定义算子。配套的 "
"vLLM 必须提供 Weight Checker API 以及下文使用的权重传输 trainer API。请使用你的 vLLM-Ascend "
"代码检出所选择的依赖版本；仅修改 `PYTHONPATH` 并不会安装其自定义算子。"

msgid ""
"This example needs two available NPUs, `curl`, `jq`, and the full\n"
"`Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` checkpoint. The server and trainer must resolve the same\n"
"checkpoint revision. Device IDs 0 and 1 below are examples; replace them\n"
"consistently with two available physical devices. Do not use dummy weights\n"
"or change the model's layer count for this checkpoint round trip."
msgstr ""
"此示例需要两个可用的 NPU、`curl`、`jq` 以及完整的 `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` checkpoint。服务器和 trainer "
"必须解析到相同的 checkpoint 版本。下文的设备 ID 0 和 1 仅为示例；请将它们一致地替换为两个可用的物理设备。在此 checkpoint"
" 往返过程中，请勿使用虚拟权重或更改模型的层数。"

msgid ""
"In terminal 1, start the server on physical NPU 0 and wait until\n"
"`curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/health` succeeds:"
msgstr ""
"在终端 1 中，在物理 NPU 0 上启动服务器，并等待\n"
"`curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/health` 成功："

msgid ""
"In terminal 2, save the following as `weight_checker_trainer.py`. It uses the\n"
"same trainer API as\n"
"[`rlhf_http_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_hccl.py),\n"
"but waits for the reset and leaves generation paused after the transfer.\n"
"Do not run that standalone example in the middle of this procedure: it\n"
"requests generation before the transfer and resumes before checksum comparison."
msgstr ""
"在终端 2 中，将以下内容保存为 `weight_checker_trainer.py`。它使用与\n"
"[`rlhf_http_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_hccl.py)\n"
"相同的 trainer API，但会等待重置，并在传输完成后保持生成暂停。请勿在此流程中途运行该独立示例：它会在传输之前请求生成，并在校验和比较之前恢复生成。"

msgid ""
"Run it with both devices visible, and wait for the `Trainer ready` prompt\n"
"before resetting the server. Leave this terminal waiting at the prompt:"
msgstr "在两个设备均可见的情况下运行它，并等待出现 `Trainer ready` 提示后再重置服务器。让此终端停留在该提示处等待："

msgid "In terminal 3, pause generation and save the original checksums:"
msgstr "在终端 3 中，暂停生成并保存原始校验和："

msgid ""
"The final command should print `true`. `baseline.json` contains the actual\n"
"parameter names and SHA-256 digests. Its response has this shape (the values\n"
"below are placeholders):"
msgstr ""
"最后一条命令应输出 `true`。`baseline.json` 包含实际的参数名称和 SHA-256 摘要。其响应格式如下（以下数值为占位符）："

msgid "Reset the weights while generation remains paused:"
msgstr "在生成保持暂停的情况下重置权重："

msgid "Expected response:"
msgstr "预期响应："

msgid ""
"Before restoring the weights, verify that comparison detects the reset.\n"
"Save a reusable comparison request so that the same baseline is used for\n"
"both checks:"
msgstr "在恢复权重之前，验证比较操作能够检测到重置。保存一个可复用的比较请求，以便两次检查使用相同的基线："

msgid ""
"The final command should print `true`. Now press Enter in terminal 2 to\n"
"transfer the *original checkpoint weights*, and wait for `Transfer complete`\n"
"and a successful trainer exit. This step must not perform a training update\n"
"or resume generation."
msgstr ""
"最后一条命令应输出 `true`。现在在终端 2 中按 Enter 以传输*原始 checkpoint 权重*，并等待出现 `Transfer "
"complete` 以及 trainer 成功退出。此步骤不得执行训练更新或恢复生成。"

msgid ""
"Back in terminal 3, compare the restored weights with the saved baseline:"
msgstr "回到终端 3，将恢复后的权重与保存的基线进行比较："

msgid "Expected response after a successful restore:"
msgstr "成功恢复后的预期响应："

msgid ""
"If `match` is `false`, inspect `mismatches` and restore the weights before\n"
"serving requests. Resume generation only after a full match:"
msgstr "如果 `match` 为 `false`，请检查 `mismatches` 并在处理请求之前恢复权重。仅在完全匹配后才恢复生成："

msgid "Finally, verify that generation works again:"
msgstr "最后，验证生成功能恢复正常："

msgid "#### Automated checks"
msgstr "#### 自动化检查"

msgid ""
"Run these commands from the repository root in the installed environment:"
msgstr "在已安装的环境中，从仓库根目录运行以下命令："

msgid ""
"The unit tests cover worker integration and mocked HCCL behavior. The E2E\n"
"suite needs two NPUs and the full `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` checkpoint. It covers\n"
"checksum/reset/reload, packed and unpacked IPC/HCCL transfers, and TP=2/DP=2\n"
"rank coverage. Its shared helpers live under `tests/e2e/common/rlhf/`.\n"
"`VLLM_RL_TEST_DEVICE_INDEX` is a logical index into the visible device list;\n"
"the trainer uses the next device. Check the pytest summary for skipped cases\n"
"before claiming the full suite passed."
msgstr ""
"单元测试覆盖 worker 集成和模拟的 HCCL 行为。E2E 测试套件需要两个 NPU 和完整的 `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` "
"checkpoint。它覆盖校验和/重置/重新加载、打包和非打包的 IPC/HCCL 传输，以及 TP=2/DP=2 的 rank "
"覆盖。其共享辅助函数位于 `tests/e2e/common/rlhf/` 下。`VLLM_RL_TEST_DEVICE_INDEX` "
"是可见设备列表中的逻辑索引；trainer 使用下一个设备。在声称完整测试套件通过之前，请检查 pytest 摘要中是否有跳过的用例。"

msgid ""
"Basic and TP/DP checksum cases use eager mode. Transfer cases use the shared\n"
"RLHF helper's `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` configuration with capture size 1. Other\n"
"graph configurations require separate validation."
msgstr ""
"基本和 TP/DP 校验和用例使用 eager 模式。传输用例使用共享 RLHF 辅助函数的 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 配置，capture"
" size 为 1。其他图配置需要单独验证。"

msgid "#### Operational constraints"
msgstr "#### 运行约束"

msgid ""
"- Stay paused from `checksum` through `compare`. Weights are invalid between\n"
"  `reset` and the transfer, and EPLB may move experts while serving. The\n"
"  worker methods do not enforce the pause; the caller must do so.\n"
"- Before `reset`, confirm that a recovery path is available: a working\n"
"  weight-transfer configuration or a checkpoint that `reload_weights` can\n"
"  restore. In RL mode, `rl_config.enabled=true` disables FRACTAL_NZ by setting\n"
"  `weight_nz_mode=0`. In a non-RL deployment where `weight_nz_mode` remains\n"
"  enabled, the weight-update transaction cannot start; checkpoint reload may\n"
"  be needed to recover after `reset`.\n"
"- If the transfer or comparison fails, keep generation paused and restore the\n"
"  weights before resuming. The engine must be awake: sleep levels 1 and 2\n"
"  release weight memory.\n"
"- `reset` is a destructive development operation. Keep development endpoints\n"
"  within a trusted access boundary and do not expose them to the public\n"
"  internet."
msgstr ""
"- 从 `checksum` 到 `compare` 期间保持暂停。在 `reset` 与权重传输之间，权重是无效的，并且 EPLB 可能在服务过程中移动专家。worker 方法不会强制执行暂停；调用方必须自行保证。\n"
"- 在 `reset` 之前，确认存在可用的恢复路径：可正常工作的权重传输配置，或可由 `reload_weights` 恢复的检查点。在 RL 模式下，`rl_config.enabled=true` 会通过设置 `weight_nz_mode=0` 禁用 FRACTAL_NZ。在非 RL 部署中，如果 `weight_nz_mode` 仍处于启用状态，则权重更新事务无法启动；在 `reset` 之后可能需要重新加载检查点才能恢复。\n"
"- 如果传输或比较失败，请保持生成暂停，并在恢复之前还原权重。引擎必须处于唤醒状态：睡眠级别 1 和 2 会释放权重内存。\n"
"- `reset` 是一种破坏性的开发操作。请将开发端点保持在可信的访问边界内，不要将其暴露到公共互联网。"

msgid "#### Limitations"
msgstr "#### 限制"

msgid ""
"In addition to the\n"
"[upstream limitations](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/weight_checker/#limitations):"
msgstr ""
"除了\n"
"[上游限制](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/weight_checker/#limitations)之外："

msgid ""
"- Weights held as buffers rather than parameters, such as some quantization\n"
"  repacking paths, are invisible to the checker.\n"
"- MoE weights padded beyond the checkpoint shape may report false mismatches;\n"
"  validate the behavior with the target model before relying on `compare`.\n"
"- Ascend 310P has not yet been verified with the Weight Checker."
msgstr ""
"- 以缓冲区而非参数形式持有的权重（例如某些量化重打包路径）对检查器不可见。\n"
"- 填充超出检查点形状的 MoE 权重可能会报告错误的失配；在依赖 `compare` 之前，请使用目标模型验证该行为。\n"
"- 昇腾 310P 尚未通过 Weight Checker 验证。"

msgid ""
"`--return-sampling-mask` enables the feature and is disabled by default.\n"
"`--logprobs-mode processed_logprobs` is required.\n"
"The following example also uses `--tokens-only` to expose the token-in/token-out\n"
"API and skip tokenizer initialization. Use `--enable-scale-out` instead to expose the\n"
"same endpoint while retaining the normal serving setup and tokenizer.\n"
"See [Tokens in, tokens out](#tokens-in-tokens-out) for serving details."
msgstr ""
"`--return-sampling-mask` 用于启用该功能，默认处于禁用状态。\n"
"需要设置 `--logprobs-mode processed_logprobs`。\n"
"以下示例还使用了 `--tokens-only` 来暴露 token-in/token-out\n"
"API 并跳过 tokenizer 初始化。若要暴露\n"
"同一端点同时保留正常的服务配置和 tokenizer，请改用 `--enable-scale-out`。\n"
"有关服务详情，请参阅 [Tokens in, tokens out](#tokens-in-tokens-out)。"

msgid ""
"Trace replay forces the engine to emit a predetermined token sequence during\n"
"decoding while computing real logprobs from the model's unmodified logit\n"
"distribution. When using the normal\n"
"`vllm serve` command with the token-in/token-out endpoint, enable the scale-out\n"
"endpoints:"
msgstr ""
"Trace replay 会强制引擎在解码期间输出预定的 token 序列，同时根据模型未经修改的 logit 分布计算真实 logprobs。当使用正常的\n"
"`vllm serve` 命令配合 token-in/token-out 端点时，请启用 scale-out\n"
"端点："

msgid ""
"`--enable-scale-out` registers the\n"
"`/inference/v1/generate` endpoint for a normal serving process.\n"
"`--enable-trace-replay` opts the server into accepting trace replay requests."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-scale-out` 会为正常的服务进程注册\n"
"`/inference/v1/generate` 端点。\n"
"`--enable-trace-replay` 使服务器选择接受 trace replay 请求。"
